Embarrassing you? How?

00:20:13.588 --> 00:20:16.967
Because it doesn't make sense.

00:20:17.175 --> 00:20:22.139
You were thinking shojo manga
don't suit me, weren't you?

00:20:22.347 --> 00:20:27.144
Cute things are for cute girls.

00:20:29.563 --> 00:20:33.817
None of them suit me.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:42.826
Class rep, you're cute.

00:20:43.034 --> 00:20:47.038
| don't get it. What are
you so embarrassed about?

00:20:47.247 --> 00:20:51.793
I'm always telling you you're cute.

00:20:52.002 --> 00:20:54.254
Don't...

00:20:56.006 --> 00:20:59.593
Don't say that so casually!

00:21:05.015 --> 00:21:07.934
But seriously.

00:21:12.147 --> 00:21:14.232
You are cute.

00:21:19.112 --> 00:21:21.698
--You idiot!
--Class rep!

00:22:10.497 --> 00:22:19.005
Another city light blinks out

00:22:19.214 --> 00:22:28.849
Seems I'm the only one
being left behind like this

00:22:29.057 --> 00:22:37.566
I leaned in close to the light
of the vending machine

00:22:37.774 --> 00:22:46.700
And bought something
other than my usual coffee

00:22:46.908 --> 00:22:51.371
I wonder if I can be myself

00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:57.419
From now on, and even further beyond

00:22:58.545 --> 00:23:07.512
Surely someday we'll come
to know sadness as love

00:23:07.721 --> 00:23:16.855
Reconnecting somewhere
and parting again, over and over

00:23:17.063 --> 00:23:30.619
Surely the day will come when we're
all too used to feeling joy

00:23:30.827 --> 00:23:37.167
Call that happiness

